         {
-          "spanish": "En la batalla de Ayacucho se derrotó de manera decisiva al último gran ejército realista del continente.",
-          "english": "At the Battle of Ayacucho, the continent's last great royalist army was decisively defeated."
+          "spanish": "La guerra continuaba cuando Iturbide y Guerrero firmaron el Plan de Iguala.",
+          "english": "The war was still going on when Iturbide and Guerrero signed the Plan of Iguala."
