+      "content": "You know *en resumen*, *lo más importante es que* and *destaca que* from B1 Unit 13, and you have seen *por un lado … por otro lado* in ordering ideas. They help to give a balance of a period: what the main challenges were, and what matters most."
     },
     {
       "type": "examples",
       "items": [
         {
-          "spanish": "A lo largo de las primeras décadas republicanas, los nuevos países enfrentaron varios desafíos al mismo tiempo.",
-          "english": "Throughout the first republican decades, the new countries faced several challenges at once."
